+/**
+ * For a frame with no GX drawing (e.g. the game is held while a menu is open): call between
+ * aurora_begin_frame and aurora_end_frame to keep the previous frame's picture instead of clearing
+ * the EFB, so it shows under the UI again. Returns false (and changes nothing) when this frame has
+ * already drawn, or when the EFB was recreated since the last frame (window resize, aspect lock,
+ * frame buffer scale): the old picture is gone, so the caller should draw a new one.
+ */
+bool aurora_preserve_frame();
 
